# 懵然不知
(pos:形容詞)
<explanation>
yue:形容一個人對某件事完全唔知，一頭霧裡，唔知點解。 (量詞：個)
eng:to be completely unaware of something; to be at a loss
<eg>
yue:佢聽完呢個消息，整個人懵然不知，唔知點解處理。 (neoi5 ting1 jyun1 ni1 go3 xit1 si1, zing2 go3 jan4 maang4 yin1 dou1, m4 ng1 dou1 di2 ching2 li.)
eng:After hearing this news, he was completely unaware and didn't know how to handle it. [end of text]


